0,"stats":[46,63,37,24,32,18],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"95","reputation":"300","equipment":{"weapon":"WP10014","armor":"WP1001305","helmet":"WP1023305"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10915","name":{"zh":"北伐中原","en":"Northern Expedition"},"year":"227","month":"3"},"faction":"WJ10020","city":"CS1059","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[46,63,37,24,32,18],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"95","reputation":"300","equipment":{"weapon":"WP10014","armor":"WP1001305","helmet":"WP1023305"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11015","name":{"zh":"再出岐山","en":"Return to Qishan"},"year":"231","month":"1"},"faction":"WJ10020","city":"CS1059","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[46,63,37,24,32,18],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"95","reputation":"300","equipment":{"weapon":"WP10014","armor":"WP1001305","helmet":"WP1023305"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11115","name":{"zh":"五丈原","en":"Wuzhang Plains"},"year":"234","month":"1"},"faction":"WJ10020","city":"CS1059","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[46,63,37,24,32,18],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"95","reputation":"300","equipment":{"weapon":"WP10014","armor":"WP1001305","helmet":"WP1023305"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10515","name":{"zh":"高平陵之变","en":"Incident at Gaoping Tombs"},"year":"249","month":"1"},"faction":"WJ10020","city":"CS1059","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[46,63,37,24,32,18],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"95","reputation":"300","equipment":{"weapon":"WP10014","armor":"WP1001305","helmet":"WP1023305"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11315","name":{"zh":"西陵之战","en":"Battle of Xiling"},"year":"272","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1008","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[46,63,37,24,32,18],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP10014","armor":"WP1001305","helmet":"WP1023305"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10108","name":{"zh":"英雄集结","en":"A Gathering of Heroes"},"year":"300","month":"3"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1005","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[46,63,37,24,32,18],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP10014","armor":"WP1001305","helmet":"WP1023305"},"couple":[]}],"storyEvents":[],"biography":{"zh":"刘备武将，初与糜芳一同协助关羽镇守荆州。关羽发动襄樊之战的战前准备中，因大意使粮仓起火而被关羽所惩罚，故与关羽结怨。关羽被徐晃击败后又遭吕蒙偷袭荆州，傅士仁怂恿糜芳一同投降，并杀害了关羽派来催粮的信使，导致关羽父子被擒。刘备亲自伐吴时，二人又杀马忠欲向刘备请罪，但未受到宽恕，被刘备下令处刑。","tc":"劉備武將，初與糜芳一同協助關羽鎮守荊州。關羽發動襄樊之戰的戰前準備中，因大意使糧倉起火而被關羽所懲罰，故與關羽結怨。關羽被徐晃擊敗后又遭呂蒙偷襲荊州，傅士仁慫恿糜芳一同投降，并殺害了關羽派來催糧的信使，導致關羽父子被擒。劉備親自伐吳時，二人又殺馬忠欲向劉備請罪，但未受到寬恕，被劉備下令處刑。","en":"Officer under Liu Bei, initially stationed alongside Mi Fang to assist Guan Yu in defending Jing Province. During the preparations for Guan Yu's Fancheng campaign, he accidentally allowed a granary fire, for which Guan Yu punished him, creating a grudge between them. After Guan Yu was defeated by Xu Huang and then ambushed by Lu Meng's seizure of Jing Province, Fu Shiren persuaded Mi Fang to surrender alongside him. They also killed the messenger Guan Yu had sent to demand supplies, contributing to Guan Yu and his son's capture. When Liu Bei personally campaigned against Wu, the two killed the Wu officer Ma Zhong and sought to plead for clemency from Liu Bei, but were denied forgiveness and executed on Liu Bei's orders.","jp":"劉備の武将。当初は糜芳とともに荊州を守る関羽を補佐した。関羽が襄樊の戦いを起こす前の準備において、不注意から兵糧庫を出火させたことで関羽に罰せられ、関羽に遺恨を抱くようになる。関羽が徐晃に敗れ、さらに呂蒙に荊州を急襲されると、傅士仁は糜芳を唆して共に降伏し、関羽が派遣した兵糧催促の使者を殺害して、関羽父子が捕縛される原因を作った。劉備が親征して呉を討った際、二人は馬忠を殺害して劉備に許しを乞おうとしたが許されず、劉備の命により処刑された。","kr":"유비 휘하의 무장으로, 처음에 미방과 함께 관우를 도와 형주를 수비했다. 관우가 양번 전투를 일으키기 전 군비를 갖추는 과정에서 부주의로 군량 창고에 불을 내 관우에게 처벌을 받자, 그에게 앙심을 품게 되었다. 관우가 서황에게 패하고 여몽이 형주를 기습하자, 부사인은 미방을 부추겨 함께 항복하고 군량을 독촉하러 온 관우의 전령을 살해하여 관우 부자가 사로잡히게 만들었다. 훗날 유비가 친히 오나라를 정벌하자 두 사람은 마충을 죽이고 유비에게 죄를 청하려 했으나, 끝내 용서받지 못하고 유비의 명에 의해 처형되었다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"0","year":"999","reason":{"zh":"","tc":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""}},"r